      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a case of nonfatal junctional epidermolysis bullosa and pyloric atresia in a newborn. We identified a substitution (c.914C>T) for the integrin β4 gene that has been associated with favorable outcome. A novel mutation (c.2011T>G) of unknown significance was also found in this patient who is now thriving."
      },
